  id: help_resonance
  displayName: Crystal resonance
  order: 600
  category: Late game
  icon: building_crystal_resonator
  body: 'Glow crystals that grow together hum. A Crystal Resonator (research Crystal Resonance) built touching a crystal cluster, or copper or iron ore leading to it, turns the hum into knowledge and speeds up the machines around it. The more crystals in the cluster, the stronger it is.


    Mining the crystals weakens it: leave the cluster standing and build around it.'
  reveal: 1
  revealBiome: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e34003af733857549a27adcfc89a230d, type: 2}
  revealResearch: {fileID: 0}
